{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Dramatic Action.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Dramatic Action.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"dramatic action dramatic action","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Dramatic Action.md","fileName":"Dramatic Action.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Dramatic Action","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-18 16:43\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Character and Interactive Story Design]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Character and Interactive Story Design","fundamentalsofgamedesign3e.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Dramatic Action.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Dramatic Action.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"dramatic action dramatic action","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Dramatic Action.md","fileName":"Dramatic Action.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Dramatic Action","heading":"Dramatic Action","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"A dramatic action is a player action that changes the direction of the plot and therefore the story events the player can experience later. It is more specific than an action that merely overcomes a gameplay challenge.\n\nThe game must communicate the action's consequences well enough for agency to be meaningful. A choice that changes only hidden data or reconverges immediately without perceptible effect may feel dramatic in code but not in experience.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Character and Interactive Story Design","fundamentalsofgamedesign3e.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Dramatic Action.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Dramatic Action.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"dramatic action dramatic action","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Dramatic Action.md","fileName":"Dramatic Action.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Dramatic Action","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[fundamentalsofgamedesign3e.pdf]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Character and Interactive Story Design","fundamentalsofgamedesign3e.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}